WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:02.210
<b>Se-no!</b>

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:02.210
<b>Ready, set!</b>

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:04.170
<b>Demo son nanja dame</b>

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:04.170
<b>But that just won't do</b>

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.130
<b>Mou son nanja hora</b>

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.130
<b>That won't do anymore, see</b>

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:09.960
<b>Kokoro wa shinka suruyo motto motto</b>

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:09.960
<b>My heart is evolving more and more</b>

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.610
<b>Kotoba ni sureba kiechau kankei nara</b>

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.610
<b>If it's a relationship that will vanish when put into words,</b>

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:30.170
<b>Kotoba wo keseba iiyatte</b>

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:30.170
<b>We can just make the words vanish instead</b>

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:31.190
<b>Omotteta</b>

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:31.190
<b>That's what I thought,</b>

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:31.990
<b>Osoreteta</b>

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:31.990
<b>That's what I feared</b>

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.960
<b>Dakedo are? Nanka chigau kamo...</b>

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.960
<b>But wait, something's not right...</b>

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>Senri no michi mo ippo kara!</b>

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>A journey of a thousand miles starts with a single step!</b>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:38.180
<b>Ishi no you ni katai sonna ishi de</b>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:38.180
<b>Armed with a resolve that's hard as a rock,</b>

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.220
<b>Chiri mo tsumoreba yamato Nadeshiko?</b>

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.220
<b>Every little drop makes a Yamato Nadeshiko?</b>

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.040
<b>"Shi" nuki de</b>

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.040
<b>I will try without the "shi"</b>

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.370
<b>Iya shinuki de!</b>

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.370
<b>I mean, I will try if it would cost my life!</b>

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:45.230
<b>Fuwa fuwari fuwa fuwaru</b>

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:45.230
<b>Fluffy-fluffy, fluffy-fluffying</b>

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:49.690
<b>Anata ga namae wo yobu sore dake de chu he ukabu</b>

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:49.690
<b>You call my name and that's enough to make me float in space</b>

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.150
<b>Fuwa fuwaru fuwa fuwari</b>

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.150
<b>Fluffy-fluffying, fluffy-fluffy</b>

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:57.610
<b>Anata ga waratte iru sore dake de egao ni naru</b>

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:57.610
<b>You're laughing and that's enough to make me smile</b>

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:01.950
<b>Kami-sama arigatou</b>

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:01.950
<b>Thank you, God</b>

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:06.200
<b>Unmei no itazura demo</b>

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:06.200
<b>Even if it was a twist of fate</b>

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:14.070
<b>Meguri aeta koto ga shiawase nano</b>

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:14.070
<b>I was lucky to have met you and I feel blessed</b>

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.070
<b>Demo son nanja dame</b>

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.070
<b>But that just won't do</b>

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.920
<b>Mou son nanja hora</b>

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.920
<b>That won't do anymore, see</b>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:21.990
<b>Kokoro wa shinka suruyo motto motto</b>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:21.990
<b>My heart is evolving more and more</b>

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:24.250
<b>Sou son nanja yada</b>

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:24.250
<b>Right, that's not what I want</b>

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:26.080
<b>Nee son nanja mada</b>

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:26.080
<b>Hey, that's still not good enough</b>

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:29.640
<b>Please watch over me, forever and forever</b>

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:29.640
<b>Watashi no koto mitete ne zutto zutto</b>

