S-Sorry to bother you, Koyomi-oniichan.

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:50.820
Hey, glad you made it, Sengoku.

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:52.000
Now, come in.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.670
I-I don't want to bother you after all so I'll be going.

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:57.590
Don't try to go home one second after you arrive!

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:00.540
G-G-Goodbye.

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:01.840
It was fun today.

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:02.760
That's not possible!

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:06.700
I-It was the best day of my life.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:11.420
Is it that enjoyable to remove your shoes
at the entrance of the Araragi home?

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:13.190
MASTER

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:13.190
Are you a master of life or something?

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.860
<i>Early August.</i>

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:19.440
<i>One day after the case involving a certain con artist wound down,</i>

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:22.430
<i>Sengoku Nadeko visited my house.</i>

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.280
Anyway, come on in.

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:26.950
I'm prepared to be a good host.

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.700
We're gonna party all night!

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:37.130
Tsukihi-chan was supposed to be here, too,

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:41.200
but it seems she's still running around, dealing with the aftermath.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:43.490
A-Aftermath?

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:44.800
What aftermath?

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.640
I mean, the aftermath of the con artist.

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:54.120
You're right! It's a party!

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:55.770
It's preparations for a party!

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:57.740
Dreamy.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:02:59.910
There we go.

